## EMDR Taps — 30 minutes
##
## Bilateral stimulation (entrain extended syntax): soft 600 Hz tone
## taps alternating left / right at 1 Hz over a quiet brown-noise bed.
## Classic EMDR pacing. Headphones required — the taps must land in
## opposite ears; on speakers they will not pan.
##
## extended syntax: entrain

off: -
taps: emdr:600/30 rate1.0 brown/25

00:00:00 off
00:00:15 taps
00:30:00 off
